    "detailed_description": "<strong>Spark Circuits</strong> is a touch-and-spark VR narrative adventure through the futuristic depths of a robot family\u2019s home. Overcome room puzzles and challenges by short circuiting the invasive robots while being mindful to not short circuit your helpful best robot friend or his little robot sister.<br><br>Featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Full English voice acting<br></li><li>Optional subtitles<br></li><li>Useful Save Spots<br></li><li>Three VR movement systems to choose from, slide, grapple teleport and/or arm swing<br></li><li>A mini-plunger grapple for grabbing all those important items</li></ul><br><strong>Spark Circuits VR</strong> \u2013 <i>Now you\u2019re sparkin' with power!</i>",
